{"book":"ruth","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:35:00.063255685Z","verse":4,"ref":"ruth 4:4","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":4,"translation":"“And I said, I will uncover your ear, saying, Buy ⟨it⟩ before those sitting here and before the elders of my people. If you will redeem ⟨it⟩, redeem ⟨it⟩; but if he will not redeem ⟨it⟩, tell me, that I may know — for there is no one besides you to redeem, and I am after you.” And he said, “I will redeem ⟨it⟩.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ואני","gloss":"And I"},{"surface":"אמרתי","gloss":"said"},{"surface":"אגלה","gloss":"I will uncover"},{"surface":"אזנך","gloss":"your ear"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"קנה","gloss":"Buy"},{"surface":"נגד","gloss":"before"},{"surface":"הישבים","gloss":"those sitting"},{"surface":"ונגד","gloss":"and before"},{"surface":"זקני","gloss":"the elders"},{"surface":"עמי","gloss":"of my people"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"If"},{"surface":"תגאל","gloss":"you will redeem"},{"surface":"גאל","gloss":"redeem"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"but if"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"יגאל","gloss":"he will redeem"},{"surface":"הגידה","gloss":"tell"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"me"},{"surface":"ואדע","gloss":"and I will know"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"there is no one"},{"surface":"זולתך","gloss":"besides you"},{"surface":"לגאול","gloss":"to redeem"},{"surface":"ואנכי","gloss":"and I"},{"surface":"אחריך","gloss":"am after you"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And he said"},{"surface":"אנכי","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"אגאל","gloss":"will redeem"}]}